WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.866
Hi! The column method makes 3-digit adding and subtracting clear. Today we'll learn regrouping in addition and subtraction.

2
00:00:11.016 --> 00:00:17.322
In the column method, line up ones under ones, tens under tens, and hundreds under hundreds.

3
00:00:17.472 --> 00:00:21.186
Add the ones first, then the tens, then the hundreds.

4
00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:26.802
5 plus 8 is 13. Write 3 and carry 1 to the tens.

5
00:00:26.952 --> 00:00:37.938
Tens: 4 plus 3 plus the 1 we carried is 8. Hundreds: 2 plus 1 is 3. The answer is 383.

6
00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:42.978
In the ones, 2 take away 6 doesn't work, so we regroup 1 ten.

7
00:00:43.128 --> 00:00:48.162
The ten becomes 10 ones. 12 minus 6 is 6.

8
00:00:48.312 --> 00:00:53.778
The 7 tens became 6 tens. 6 minus 5 is 1.

9
00:00:53.928 --> 00:01:07.914
Hundreds: 4 minus 1 is 3. The answer is 316. Check with addition: 316 plus 156 is 472.

10
00:01:08.064 --> 00:01:14.130
Watch out! When 2 minus 6 doesn't work, we can't just do 6 minus 2!

11
00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:19.362
Regroup 1 ten to make 12, then 12 minus 6 is 6.

12
00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:24.258
Don't forget the tens place now has 1 less.

13
00:01:24.408 --> 00:01:34.674
Your turn! What is 365 plus 278? Pause and think.

14
00:01:34.824 --> 00:01:52.482
Ones: 13, write 3 carry 1. Tens: 6 plus 7 plus 1 is 14, write 4 carry 1. Hundreds: 3 plus 2 plus 1 is 6. It's 643. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:52.632 --> 00:02:02.586
Another one! What is 503 minus 247? Pause and think.

16
00:02:02.736 --> 00:02:17.586
The tens is 0, so regroup from the hundreds first. 13 minus 7 is 6, 9 minus 4 is 5, 4 minus 2 is 2. It's 256. Did you get it right?

17
00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:27.210
Here's another! What is 600 minus 125? Pause and think.

18
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:39.786
Regroup twice: 10 minus 5 is 5, 9 minus 2 is 7, 5 minus 1 is 4. It's 475. Did you get it right?

19
00:02:39.936 --> 00:02:52.986
Try one more! A shop has 438 apples and 256 more arrive. How many altogether? Pause and think.

20
00:02:53.136 --> 00:03:03.762
Altogether means add: 438 plus 256 is 694 apples. Did you get it right?

21
00:03:03.912 --> 00:03:15.234
Last one! Check by adding: what is 316 plus 156? Pause and think.

22
00:03:15.384 --> 00:03:30.282
316 plus 156 is 472, so 472 minus 156 is 316 is correct. Did you get it right?

23
00:03:30.432 --> 00:03:40.050
Remember: line up the places and start from the ones. Carry 1 when you reach 10, regroup 1 when you can't subtract, and check your answer.

24
00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:44.802
Make up two sums to test your family today!

